{
  "uid": "vs-delivery-playback",
  "title": "Delivery & Playback",
  "tags": ["video-service"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard covers",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Browsers fetch segments **directly from object storage** - Caddy and the JVM are deliberately not in the media data path (CLAUDE.md 9.3). No `http_server_requests` metric can see a single segment, so this dashboard is the only place delivery problems show up.\n\n**Origin latency** is a synthetic probe from the server. **Playback** panels are real viewers, reported by hls.js. With 4-second segments, a segment load approaching 4 s means the buffer drains faster than it fills and playback will stall."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Origin latency (p95)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(videoservice_delivery_origin_request_seconds_bucket[15m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 2 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Origin probe failures (1h)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(videoservice_delivery_origin_request_seconds_count{outcome!=\"ok\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "failures"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Viewer segment load (p95)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(videoservice_playback_fragment_load_seconds_bucket[15m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 4 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Stalls (1h)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(videoservice_playback_stalls_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "stalls"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Origin request latency (synthetic probe)",
      "description": "Round-trip against the media origin from the server. A 4 s segment budget is the reference line: sustained latency near or above it makes stall-free playback impossible no matter what the viewer's bandwidth is.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(videoservice_delivery_origin_request_seconds_bucket[10m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(videoservice_delivery_origin_request_seconds_bucket[10m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(videoservice_delivery_origin_request_seconds_bucket[10m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Origin probe outcomes (per hour)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(videoservice_delivery_origin_request_seconds_count[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Viewer segment load time by rendition",
      "description": "What hls.js actually measured. Diverging from the synthetic probe means the problem sits between the origin and viewers rather than at the origin.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, height) (rate(videoservice_playback_fragment_load_seconds_bucket[10m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{height}}p"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Viewer throughput by rendition",
      "description": "Effective per-segment throughput as seen by the player. Compare against the declared ladder bitrate (360p 800, 720p 2500, 1080p 4500 kbit/s) - below it, ABR will keep shifting down.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (height) (rate(videoservice_playback_fragment_throughput_sum[10m])) / sum by (height) (rate(videoservice_playback_fragment_throughput_count[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{height}}p"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Kbits",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Stalls and segment errors (per hour)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (height) (increase(videoservice_playback_stalls_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "stalls {{height}}p"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (height) (increase(videoservice_playback_fragment_errors_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "errors {{height}}p"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time to first frame (p95)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(videoservice_playback_startup_seconds_bucket[10m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
